# 91. The Most Important Mental Model

Do not memorize 20 unrelated equations.

Think of the LSTM as seven operations.

## Forward

### Operation 1

$$
z=[h_{\text{prev}},x]
$$

### Operation 2

$$
a=Wz+b
$$

### Operation 3

$$
f=\sigma(a_f)
$$

$$
i=\sigma(a_i)
$$

$$
g=\tanh(a_g)
$$

$$
o=\sigma(a_o)
$$

### Operation 4

$$
c=fc_{\text{prev}}+ig
$$

### Operation 5

$$
h=o\tanh(c)
$$

---

## Backward

Reverse them.

### Operation 5

$$
h\rightarrow o,c
$$

### Operation 4

$$
c\rightarrow f,i,g,c_{\text{prev}}
$$

### Operation 3

$$
f,i,g,o
\rightarrow
a_f,a_i,a_g,a_o
$$

### Operation 2

$$
a\rightarrow W,b,z
$$

### Operation 1

$$
z\rightarrow h_{\text{prev}},x.
$$

That is the LSTM.

